<section class="rb-letter rb-letter--alt">
  <div class="rb-letter-inner">
    <img
      class="rb-letter-portrait"
      src="/imagery/forgiveness/jacob.jpg"
      alt="Jacob Vermeulen"
      loading="lazy"
    />
    <p class="rb-section-italic rb-section-italic--center">A note from Jacob</p>
    <h2 class="rb-letter-head">
      This retreat is built around one of the most ancient human technologies.
    </h2>
    <p class="rb-letter-body">
      The circle. The voice. The ritual of being part of something larger
      than ourselves.
    </p>
    <p class="rb-letter-body">
      Some of you are coming back. Some are coming for the first time. The
      work of these three days is to make a space where neither matters —
      where each person, whatever they bring, can drop into the circle and
      be received.
    </p>
    <p class="rb-letter-body">
      We will sound together. We will sit in silence together. We will
      share meals at one table. And in the centre of it all, we will craft
      a <em>ritual of belonging</em> — something none of us can make alone.
    </p>
    <p class="rb-letter-sig">— Jacob</p>
  </div>
</section>
